WEBVTT

1-1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:08.777
StackOps organizes its commands into a hierarchy for machine setup, cloud services, terminals, agents, and everyday tools.

1-2
00:00:08.927 --> 00:00:14.964
DevOps groups installation, configuration, repositories, data, networking, and security.

1-3
